{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5dec8225-f94b-84eb-b0bb-6d66e12b13b4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:36:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Please, I would like to report a problem with a sidewalk. Can you hear me okay? I am on my cell phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:34:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I got you. Little bit of static but go ahead. What's going on with the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. The sidewalk has heaved up, one of the slabs is lifted, and I tripped on it yesterday. [line breaks up] I did not fall all the way, but it is dangerous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sidewalk heaved, tripped on it. Where is this? Sorry, you broke up on me there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, excuse me. It is at 290 Carroll Avenue, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two ninety Carroll Avenue. Got it. Is that in front of the house or down the block a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In front of the house, please. And one more thing, it is right in the bike lane, so a person on a bicycle could be hurt also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the bike lane, okay. I'm writing that down. Did the storm do this, the one over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think the storm from Friday into Saturday, three days ago, made it worse. Maybe the frost also. Excuse me, [inaudible] I did not hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it sounds like the freeze and the storm both. I'll put it in as a trip hazard so they look at it sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Please, can you tell me how long repairs usually take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It varies. After a storm the crews have a pile of work, so it could be a few weeks. They'll inspect it first and then schedule it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Also, if I may say, the street smells like woodsmoke most evenings. I do not know if that is for your department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That one's not really us, but I'll note it in the comments so it gets passed along. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:36:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one six seven. All set, Mr. Santoro."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for your help. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
